  "wrong_options_that_fit": "",
  "instruction_problem": "'Make it indirect' gives no opening phrase, so there are many correct answers (Can/Could you tell me, Do you know, I wonder, I'd like to know...) and 'indirect' could also be read as reported speech. Give the opening (e.g. 'Start with Could you tell me').",
  "level_problem": "",
  "sense_problem": "'Why didn't the order arrive?' is slightly unnatural for a still-missing order; BrE would say 'Why hasn't the order arrived?'."
 },
